WEBVTT

00:43:59.430 --> 00:44:03.621
because AI is able to do
routine tasks better than people

00:44:03.645 --> 00:44:05.057
in a single domain.

00:44:05.363 --> 00:44:10.445
And a lot of the jobs
that exist today are routine jobs.

00:44:10.768 --> 00:44:13.792
Both white-collar
as well as blue-collar jobs.

00:44:13.816 --> 00:44:15.378
If you add up all these jobs

00:44:15.402 --> 00:44:19.506
that have large percentages
of routine components,

00:44:19.530 --> 00:44:23.768
we're going to end up with a large number,
like 40 percent of our jobs.

00:44:23.792 --> 00:44:27.370
And it doesn't mean there will be
40 percent unemployment,

00:44:27.394 --> 00:44:33.031
but AI will be able to do most of the jobs
of 40 percent of the people